From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000008 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: cubie-a7s: drop the SPI-NOR flash drivers

sunxi-cubie-a7s-drop-dead-storage-paths removed the SATA and UFS paths and left these standing, because whether
this board populates a SPI flash was not established and removing eight chip
drivers on an assumption is how you find out the hard way.

It is established now: no board in the A7S family carries a SPI flash.
That makes the whole block dead text -- nine chip drivers, the MTD glue and
the sf test command, for a chip that is not on the board.

The firmware path is unchanged by this and was already settled: U-Boot is
loaded from eMMC where present, otherwise from the card. The BROM would
happily boot SPI NOR -- it sits in the try order between RAW NAND and SPI
NAND -- but on a board with no such chip that branch can only ever fail.

⚠ Removing the chip drivers is not enough on its own: CONFIG_SPI_FLASH and
CONFIG_CMD_SF are not in this defconfig at all, they arrive from the defaults,
and the built image still carried the whole sf sub-system with them. So both
are explicitly unset here rather than left to be implied.

Kept on purpose: CONFIG_SPI and CONFIG_CMD_SPI. The controller is not the
flash. Something else on a header may want it, and nothing here says
otherwise.

Falsifier: a boot chain built without these, booting unchanged from the card,
and still finding the drive.

Assisted-by: Claude

diff --git a/src/configs/radxa-cubie-a7s_defconfig b/src/configs/radxa-cubie-a7s_defconfig
--- a/src/configs/radxa-cubie-a7s_defconfig
+++ b/src/configs/radxa-cubie-a7s_defconfig
@@ -15,9 +15,8 @@
 CONFIG_SPL_RAM_DEVICE=y
 CONFIG_CMD_DFU=y
 CONFIG_CMD_I2C=y
-CONFIG_CMD_MTD=y
-CONFIG_CMD_SF_TEST=y
 CONFIG_CMD_SPI=y
+# CONFIG_CMD_SF is not set
 CONFIG_NET_RANDOM_ETHADDR=y
 CONFIG_ADC=y
 CONFIG_SUNXI_GPADC=y
@@ -29,18 +28,6 @@
 CONFIG_SYS_I2C_EEPROM_ADDR=0x50
 CONFIG_SYS_I2C_EEPROM_ADDR_OVERFLOW=0x7
 CONFIG_SUPPORT_EMMC_BOOT=y
-CONFIG_MTD=y
-CONFIG_MTD_BLOCK=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_SOFT_RESET=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_SOFT_RESET_ON_BOOT=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_MACRONIX=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_SPANSION=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_STMICRO=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_SST=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_WINBOND=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_XMC=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_DATAFLASH=y
-CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_MTD=y
 CONFIG_DM_MDIO=y
 CONFIG_DM_ETH_PHY=y
 CONFIG_DWC_ETH_QOS=y
@@ -60,6 +47,8 @@
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_AXP=y
 CONFIG_CMD_PCI=y
 CONFIG_SPI=y
+# CONFIG_SPI_FLASH is not set
+# CONFIG_DM_SPI_FLASH is not set
 CONFIG_WDT=y
 CONFIG_WDT_SUNXI=y
 CONFIG_WATCHDOG=y
